---
smd: 2
title: Missing, ambiguous, cyclic and unresolved
---

## Missing

:::requirement{#R1 depends-on=NOPE}
Needs a block nobody wrote.
:::

## Ambiguous

:::requirement{#R2 depends-on=DUP}
Needs a block two blocks claim.
:::

## Cycle

:::requirement{#R3 depends-on=R4}
Needs R4.
:::

## Store

:::requirement{#DUP}
First copy DUP-ONE.
:::

:::requirement{#DUP}
Second copy DUP-TWO.
:::

:::requirement{#R4 depends-on=R3}
Needs R3 back.
:::

## Rules

:::constraint{#C99 applies-to=R99}
A rule whose target was deleted UNPLACED.
:::
